mcprack (0.2.18) unstable; urgency=medium

  * wsgi.py: wrap the app in werkzeug's ProxyFix (x_proto=1, x_host=1) so
    it trusts X-Forwarded-Proto/-Host from the Apache reverse proxy.
    Without it, url_for(..., _external=True) - used for the proxy/mcp
    URLs handed to MCP clients - generated http:// URLs even when served
    over https, since the Apache<->gunicorn hop itself is plain HTTP.

 -- CyberVitexus <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Tue, 28 Jul 2026 14:30:00 +0200

