 -- CyberVitexus <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Tue, 28 Jul 2026 02:07:15 +0200

mcprack (0.2.11) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix cold-start proxy spawns failing the startup handshake: the
    health probe made a single connection attempt with no retry, so a
    backend that takes longer than the ~0.2s post-spawn grace period to
    bind its HTTP port (e.g. first-ever import of freshly installed
    dependencies) got connection-refused and was declared broken, even
    though it would have come up fine moments later. Now retries on
    connection-refused until the handshake timeout budget is exhausted.

 -- CyberVitexus <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Mon, 27 Jul 2026 18:12:08 +0200

mcprack (0.2.10) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Only run db.create_all() as a fallback for databases Alembic has
    never touched. Previously it ran unconditionally on every app boot,
    including inside 'flask db upgrade', so it would create a model's
    table before Alembic's own migration for that table got a chance to
    run -- causing the migration to fail with 'table already exists'
    (seen with audit_log_entries).
  * Fix the same missing debconf confmodule sourcing in postrm (same
    root cause as the postinst fix in 0.2.8).

 -- CyberVitexus <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Mon, 27 Jul 2026 13:27:11 +0200

